Package: apolloexplorer
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libc6, libqt6core6 | libqt6core6t64, libqt6gui6 | libqt6gui6t64, libqt6widgets6 | libqt6widgets6t64, libqt6network6 | libqt6network6t64
Maintainer: Rony Beck <ronybeck@themenz.biz>
Homepage: https://github.com/ronybeck/ApolloExplorer
Description: File explorer client for the Apollo Amiga accelerator
 ApolloExplorer is a file sharing utility for getting files to and
 from your Amiga from the comfort of your PC. A server component runs
 in the background on the Amiga (Apollo V4) and allows this client to
 connect, browse local disks and transfer files over the network.
 .
 This package installs the ApolloExplorer GUI client, the acp
 command line copy tool and the ash remote shell tool.
